===== Invalid marking leaves task state unchanged =====
Console input:
todo write tests
mark not-a-number
list
mark 1
list
unmark 1
list
bye
Console output:
ORDER PROCESSED: [T][ ] WRITE TESTS
BUT, IT IS INVALID.
VERY WELL. HERE IS YOUR LIST:
1.[T][ ] write tests
THEN, IT IS DONE.
[T][X] write tests
VERY WELL. HERE IS YOUR LIST:
1.[T][X] write tests
THEN, IT WAS AS IF IT WAS NEVER DONE.
[T][ ] write tests
VERY WELL. HERE IS YOUR LIST:
1.[T][ ] write tests
RESULT: PASSED
